criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* age \>18 years;
* provision of written informed consent and ability to understand the informed consent form.

Exclusion Criteria:

* patients with ST-segment elevation myocardial infarction (STEMI);
* patients with very-high-risk non-ST-segment elevation myocardial infarction (NSTEMI), as classified according to the 2023 European Society of Cardiology (ESC) Guidelines;
* patients in cardiogenic shock;
* presence of hearing impairment or deafness, assessed through clinical history;
* patients unable to express their musical preferences;
* patients with resuscitated cardiac arrest;
* use of antipsychotic medications, assessed through clinical history;
* history of epilepsy, assessed through clinical history.
